# Frontend environment variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# IMPORTANT: VITE_API_URL must include the /api path prefix.
#
# Local development:
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
#
# Production (Vercel) — set this as a Vercel environment variable:
# VITE_API_URL=https://hostel-awdt.onrender.com/api
#                                                ^^^^
#                             The /api suffix is REQUIRED.
#
# Without /api the frontend will hit /auth/register (404) instead of
# /api/auth/register which is where the backend actually mounts the routes.
